- 909eb1da8 JVM: keep a class under the JVM's resolved-reference ceiling

= JVM: make the eval server survive more than four runs
Per-run state (dispatch bootstrap, grammar-engine programs, global context)
is reset between runs; shutdown hooks no longer pin every run. IntelliJ
project files are ignored.
- 1a4d18377 JVM: make the eval server survive more than four runs
- 80073333c Ignore IntelliJ project files
- b016312e2 JVM: stop shutdown hooks from pinning every eval-server run

